  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A travelling wave on the surface of a lake has wavelength <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span>. Two points along the wave oscillate with the phase difference of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\pi\"></span>. What is the smallest possible distance between these two points?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda}{4}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\lambda}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\lambda\"></span></li></ol>"
